-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Why GPL-3.0
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Release builds link org.jellyfin.media3:media3-ffmpeg-decoder, whose published
Maven POM declares "GNU General Public License v3.0". An APK that contains it
is therefore distributed as a whole under GPL-3.0-compatible terms. Marquee's
own source is licensed GPL-3.0-or-later so that the combined work is
consistent. All other runtime libraries (Apache-2.0) and the bundled font
(SIL OFL 1.1) are compatible with GPLv3. Details and evidence:
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

